WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.350
Last time on...

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.790
<i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.150
Last time on <i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.900
Aqours has moved on
to the Love Live final round.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.230
This is really it?

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.230
"Applications Closed"

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:11.820
But we couldn't get enough applicants

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.530
and the school merger decision became final.

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:16.660
Chika and the rest of us
lost our bearings, but then...

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:20.200
We want you to immortalize our school's name!

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.790
We will win!

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.500
We will win and leave our
school's name in Love Live history!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.420
Let's make memories that will never fade!

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.510
Where are we?

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.630
We can't see anything.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.270
Heaven has...

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.980
...forsaken us, <i>zura</i>.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.100
So this is snow white... How beautiful...

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.860
Get a hold of yourself, Mari!

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.820
How dare you, snow?! Don't underestimate me!

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.780
--Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>?!
--It's Yohane!

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:55.320
I should dodge it!
I should dodge it! I should dodge it!

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.700
I'm getting sleepy for some reason.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.370
--Me, too.
--No! If you fall asleep, you'll die!

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.660
Don't fall asleep!

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:06.960
This is a dream. A dream.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:11.750
Yeah. Because there's no way
that it'd snow this hard in Uchiura.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:17.510
Then if I just close my eyes and fall asleep,
I'll wake up at my house...

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.800
Not.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.600
Because we are in...

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.060
"Welcome to Hokkaido"

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:25.850
Hokkaido!

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:26.980
What?

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:42.160
<i>Let's throw our all at each other</i>
<i>and grab hold of the future!</i>

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:52.800
<i>The sky and this ocean are both on our side</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.760
<i>Shining and saying, "Go, do your best!"</i>

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:03.470
<i>To let our voices reach far, far away</i>

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:08.390
<i>Shall we shout our dreams louder?</i>

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.150
<i>(Full of hope)</i>

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:14.480
<i>Today pulls tomorrow toward itself</i>

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:23.080
<i>It's really fun to grasp the magnet</i>
<i>in my heart and run right now!</i>

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:25.200
<i>(Let's always go together)</i>

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.000
<i>What shall we do about the future?!</i>

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:35.800
<i>Everyone laughs and cries</i>
<i>as</i> <i>they</i> <i>look for the shape of their dreams</i>

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:44.220
<i>Because I'm sure the</i> <i>future</i> <i>us</i>
<i>will have the answer</i>

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:52.310
<i>Let's run with everything we have</i>
<i>and become the shining wind</i>

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:55.650
<i>We got dream</i>

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:01.280
Wow... We've come
all the way to Hakodate, huh?

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.990
I never even dreamed that we'd get

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.990
"Love Live Hokkaido Regional
Prelims Viewing Guide"
"For Aqours, School Idols from Uranohoshi Girls' High School"

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:05.990
invited to one of the
regional prelims as guests.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:07.830
Ahh, it's cold.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.830
You-<i>chan</i>, you should wear more layers.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.540
Now, let's go!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.340
My little demon, Lili!

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.960
--What?!
--Let us journey to a new world!

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:20.300
Ow!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.180
You shouldn't wear shoes like that
on a snow-covered street.

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.220
She's right!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:26.640
In a situation like this, we wear these!

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.430
--Ta-da!
--Ta-da!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.480
Now we're all set!

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.190
That's smart, sis!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:36.730
--With these, even a snow mountain like this
is no problem for us! See?!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:36.730
--With these, even a snow mountain like this is no problem for us! See?!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.780
--Sis!
--Oh no...! Why?!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:44.910
--I-I can't pull my leg out!
--Thanks for waiting, <i>zura</i>.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.700
I'm finally warm, <i>zura</i>!

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:48.990
Hanamaru-<i>chan</i>?!

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:52.160
I'm round all-around, <i>zura</i>!

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:53.620
Hey...

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:57.460
I can't come to a sudden stop, <i>zura</i>!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.880
--<i>Zura</i>!
--Hey!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.340
I'm sorry, <i>zura</i>!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.050
Ahh...! We're finally here.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:08.720
What a big crowd!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.810
"Hokkaido Regional Prelims Final Round"

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:14.060
"School: Hakodate Seisen Girls' High School"
"Members: Sarah Kazuno, Third-year student"
"Leah Kazuno, First-year student"

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.980
Ah! Here's Saint Snow!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.060
Just as you'd expect
from one of the event favorites!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.310
Y-Yeah.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:21.440
Then let us see the victor
of this land with our own eyes.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:22.610
Excuse me...

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.910
You guys are Aqours... right?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:26.530
Hm?

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:29.830
W-Well... Um...

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.960
Um, can we take a picture with you?!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.380
H-H-Hey, let's c-c-calm down, guys!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.340
You, too, Riko-<i>chan</i>.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:40.340
Squee!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:44.470
Thank you very much! I'm rooting for you!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.550
Good luck!

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.430
--Thank you! We'll do our best!
--I'm so happy!

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.900
Advancing to the final round
is a pretty big deal, huh?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.640
Yeah, it really is a big deal.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.850
Yeah.

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.900
Excuse us...

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.400
We came to see Saint Snow.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.400
Yes?

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.990
Oh, hello. It's been a while.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.330
Sorry to stop by before your performance.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.660
That's okay. I hope you'll enjoy
our performance today,

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:16.330
as it'll be a while before
we compete in the final round.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.270
Thank you. We will.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:22.710
What? Do they already think
that they'll advance to the finals?

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:27.010
They've got quite a bit of confidence, <i>zura</i>.
And lots of gifts, too, <i>zura</i>.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:32.600
They won an overwhelming victory
in last year's regional prelims, so...

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:38.310
Could it be that you're
trying to show off your talent again?

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.560
No, I have no such intentions.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:44.780
Besides, I doubt there's anything
we could do that would phase you now.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.700
What do you mean?

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:50.200
Aqours has improved remarkably.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:53.120
You're now unmistakably
one of the Love Live favorites.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.000
One of the Love Live favorites...

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.300
We spoke rudely to you that time.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.470
I apologize.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:02.960
Sarah-<i>san</i>...

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.680
Next time we see you,
it'll be at the final round.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:12.870
Let's make it an event
that goes down in Love Live history.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:15.540
Chika-<i>chan</i>.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.560
You're supposed to accept her challenge.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:19.550
She's right.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.170
Okay.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.450
Leah! Come say hello to them.

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:32.250
Leah!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:36.940
Ah, please don't worry. You guys have to
get ready for your performance, so...

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.580
Wow! Listen to those cheers!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.710
The hall is filled with people, too!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:50.510
Watching from here, we should be able
to learn how we appear on the stage.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:55.290
As well as what we can do
to entertain the audience.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.180
Yeah.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.560
When is Saint Snow's turn?

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.150
If I remember correctly, it should be next.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.360
Ah! It's starting, <i>zura</i>.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.030
It's show time!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:23.330
"Hokkaido Regional Prelims Final Round"
"Ashimo☆eeru"

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.410
That was shocking.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:23.330
To think that something
like that would happen...

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.380
This is Love Live...

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:29.170
Once you make a mistake,
it's really hard to bounce back.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.430
It could happen to us, too?

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.050
That's right, <i>zura</i>.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:39.770
But Saint Snow can no longer
advance to the final round... right?

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.400
Come in.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.780
Excuse me...

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:55.870
It seems that Saint Snow already went home.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:01.460
We're having a send-off party after this
for those who have advanced to the final.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:05.210
Sarah-<i>san</i> told us
that they'd be waiting here, but...

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:09.170
They seemed different than usual today.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:12.720
Leah-<i>chan</i> was silent all that time, too.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.470
I've never seen them like that before.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.930
It made them so shaken
that there was no way they could sing.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.650
Also, it seemed that they were
having a bit of a fight.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.660
You're still thinking about them?

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:42.870
Yeah.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.570
They've been performing together all this time.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.930
But they made a mistake
in their last Love Live together

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:50.710
and even had a fight.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:51.800
Yeah...

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:55.380
I wonder if it'd be better
if we don't go see them after all...

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.060
Yeah. It could be really awkward.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:02.220
Even if we feel terrible,
there's nothing we can do.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:03.980
That may be right.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.560
It's Saint Snow we're talking about.
They'll be okay.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:08.690
Yeah. They're sisters and they're very close.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:09.400
Yeah.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:13.280
Well then, let's go check in
at the hotel after this.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.780
I heard that it'll clear up tomorrow,
so we'll go sightseeing here in Hakodate.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.700
Well then, let's go find me
some little demons in this city!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.260
--No way, <i>zura</i>.
--Hey!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.670
Wow...

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.790
Amazing...! This is amazing!

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:32.130
That shape somehow looks delicious, <i>zura</i>.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:35.010
What a sight...! There is no mistake.

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:38.010
This is, indeed, the magic circle
that I've always dreamed of!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.140
Calm down.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:43.270
Whoosh! With this, I can summon
the legendary super colossal little demon!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.520
Hold on a sec, <i>zura</i>.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.890
Is that big? Or small?

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.100
How cool...

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.440
I'm not afraid at all.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:55.910
H-Hey!

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:59.620
--Wow, you're bold, Kanan!
--Hey! Are you okay, Kanan-<i>san</i>?!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.410
This place is really relaxing, isn't it?

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:07.160
It reminds me of Uchiura.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.460
Oh yeah.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:12.630
This town overlooks the ocean
and there's a scent of sea water in the air.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.920
And there's a school at the top of the hill.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:19.520
Even places that are far apart
can actually be very similar, huh?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.560
Thanks for waiting, <i>zura</i>.

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.060
Oh no!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:25.930
Again?!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.480
Why are you wearing so many layers again?!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.940
She never learns.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.860
It's cold...

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.780
Shall we have teatime then?

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:37.780
Agreed!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:41.240
Th-This is it, <i>zura</i>. I can't walk anymore, <i>zura</i>.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.660
So...

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.040
"Whale Soup, New Year's Dish
in Southern Hokkaido" "Matcha Green Tea"

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.280
Whale soup?

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.040
That's unique.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:49.370
--<i>Zura</i>?
--Excuse me.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:53.040
Excuse me!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.710
Hm?

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.550
It does say it's open.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.430
I-I'd at least like to go inside
for a little while, <i>zura</i>.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.390
I guess it can't be helped.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:08.560
Well then, we're coming in!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.150
I'm finally saved, <i>zura</i>.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:18.190
Zuramaru, take off some of the layers first.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.610
Now, I'll help you.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.990
--Ow, ow, ow...
--Oof.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.200
I want to eat red bean soup.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.710
The winter-only parfait sounds good, too!

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.100
<i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.480
Wow...! How pretty!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.780
It looks really tasty!

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:01.530
It'll warm you up pretty good.
Please go ahead and eat.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:05.280
Thank you! This is a nice restaurant
with a great ambiance.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:08.490
--Yeah.
--That uniform is cute, too!

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:11.790
This tastiness... Could this be
a gift from the celestial sphere?!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:12.870
I'd like seconds, <i>zura</i>!

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.330
That was fast!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.170
I heard that you guys might stop by our school,

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.840
but I'm surprised to see you here.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:22.840
Ah, yes. Since we've come all this way,
we decided to go sightseeing.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.590
And then we came across this place.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:29.850
The scenery is wonderful, too,
with a calm, romantic atmosphere.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.730
Thank you very much.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:35.190
Both Leah and I love this town.
So when we become adults,

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.610
we want to take over
this restaurant together and live here.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.440
You do...

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:43.990
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:45.820
It's okay... but...

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.450
If you're done eating, hurry up and leave!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.530
Wha...?!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:51.080
Leah! Don't speak like that!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:56.710
If you tell anyone about earlier,
I'll make you pay.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.250
Leah!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:06.680
I'm sorry. She seems to still be troubled
by what happened yesterday.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:09.140
Yeah, that's understandable.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.270
We heard that you two
had a bit of a fight at the--

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:12.640
<i>Zura</i>!

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.850
It's okay. It's Love Live we're talking about.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.900
Something like that can happen.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:22.990
I don't have any regrets.
So next time, I'm sure Leah will...

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.860
No!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.610
I won't change my mind no matter what.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.780
I will quit being a school idol!

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.450
Saint Snow is now over!

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:33.950
Are you really sure?

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:35.580
You're a first-year student.

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:38.040
--You'll get another chance next year.
--I'm sure.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:42.760
I no longer want anything
to do with Love Live or school idols.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.930
I'm sorry you had to see
such an embarrassing scene.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.640
Please enjoy your food.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.440
It's the future, <i>zura</i>!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.360
Hey... Are you going to eat that by yourself?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.650
<i>Zura</i>!

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.980
Let me have a bite... Just a bite...

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.230
No, <i>zura</i>.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.610
What's the big deal?!

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:08.280
--Just one bite! I'll give you some of my fries!
--She doesn't have to quit over it...

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:13.540
But even if she is to continue,
she'll be by herself next year, right?

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.950
She can recruit new members
and have a fresh start.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:19.120
But to her it's not that simple, is it?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.830
Yeah... I guess.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:24.340
We were like that, too.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:29.470
In the end, a mistake on stage
can be made up only on stage.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:36.310
But people's feelings aren't so simple
that they can shift gears right away.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:39.520
I wonder if she lost her confidence.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.860
I don't think it's like that.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:47.150
Because Sarah-<i>san</i> won't be there any more...

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:51.660
I think she doesn't like the fact that
she can't be a school idol with her big sister.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:55.740
She probably doesn't want to continue
if she isn't with her sister.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.000
Ruby...

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.960
Eep!

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.460
You are...

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.580
...amazing, <i>zura</i>...

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.630
Yeah... It'll be lonely.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:09.380
N-No! It's not like that! It's just that
Leah-<i>chan</i> was crying so--Ah...

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.800
Crying?

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.690
It's pretty, isn't it?

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:32.110
Did Leah-<i>san</i> say something to you?

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.030
No.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:37.080
I just thought...

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.210
...that it must be the case...

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:42.750
...because that's how I feel.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.210
Ruby...

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:51.590
Sis... Once the final round is over,
you, too, will be...

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.390
There's nothing we can do about it.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:57.350
But you were so attracted
to being a school idol...

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.770
You worked so hard to be one...

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.310
And yet, it'll be over soon...

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:10.610
I am quite satisfied.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:14.820
Kanan-<i>san</i>, Mari-<i>san</i>,
second years and first years...

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:19.700
And most of all, you Ruby...
I was able to be a school idol with you all.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.210
And we're going to the Love Live final round.

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:30.670
We're going to Akiba Dome. It's like a dream.

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:35.930
But... I want to keep singing with you.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.810
I want to follow your lead...

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:43.480
I want to be right by your side...

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:47.610
I want to train hard with you.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:50.690
Don't leave me behind.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.080
You've grown.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.870
And you've become even prettier.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.750
That's...

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:11.840
What're you going to do after the final round?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:16.180
I don't know. But our school will be closed

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:19.680
and you third years will be gone.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.470
Yeah.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.850
What about you, sis?

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.940
Well... I won't know

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.980
until that time comes...

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:35.200
Right now, I'm trying to stay focused
on the Love Live final round, so...

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.410
Yeah.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.990
But...

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.410
But...

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.410
What are older sisters like?

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.540
Hmm... I don't know.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:49.590
Given how my sisters are,
it's not like we're super close or anything.

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:52.550
But then, maybe we are after all.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:53.550
I see...

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:57.510
Remember when we had a concert
at school for the first time?

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:00.430
Mito-<i>nee</i> came to see it in the rain.

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:07.060
The moment I saw her, I almost cried,
thinking, "Ah! It's Mito-<i>nee</i>!"

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:11.520
That sounds nice... though I don't really
understand things like that.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:16.490
I don't understand it well, either,
because it's so natural to me.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:20.820
Older sisters are always there
from the day you're born, you know.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.950
Hm? Where's Ruby?

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:29.880
She went out. She said there was
somewhere she wanted to go, <i>zura</i>.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:30.920
I see.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:37.380
That's the hamburger
we bought for Ruby, isn't it?

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.550
She said she didn't want it.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:43.470
--The signs of your
impending doom are everywhere.
--Hm? What do you mean, <i>zura</i>?

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:45.220
You are such a happy person.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:19:02.120
But when you told me
that you wanted to be a school idol,

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:05.740
it made me really happy.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:08.000
I thought, "Unbeknownst to me,

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:11.880
Ruby was thinking really hard
about things independently

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:15.800
and came to a conclusion all on her own."

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:29.440
Excuse me...

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.270
You...

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:34.650
I'm Ruby... Ruby Kurosawa.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:39.650
I'd like to... I'd like to talk to you.
It won't take long.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:49.710
Hey, how far are we going?
What is it that you want to talk about?

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:56.380
I'm not done with work yet,
so I want you to make it quick.

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:04.010
Um... Just like you, Leah-<i>cha</i>--
I mean, Leah-<i>san</i>, I have a big sister, too.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.430
Dia Kurosawa.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.720
You knew?!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.560
I did some research on Aqours, so...

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:13.940
But my sister is better.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:17.860
She's pretty, and her singing
and dancing are first-class.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:22.200
I-I think my sister is as good as yours.

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.240
But she can't do a backflip, can she?

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:27.490
But she's so good at classical
Japanese dance that she could teach it,

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:29.080
and she can play the <i>koto</i>, too!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.160
Those things have nothing to do
with being a school idol!

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:36.040
That's not true! Kanan-<i>chan</i> said
that the basics needed are the same!

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:40.090
But my sister is better than yours!

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:44.550
You really love Sarah-<i>san</i> so much.

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.300
Of course! Why wouldn't I?!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:50.020
And what's with you?!
You're usually as timid as a mouse!

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:53.890
Because I love my sister so much.

00:20:55.560 --> 00:21:02.150
And after talking to her,
I learned that she's happy.

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:03.280
About what?

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:06.450
Even if my sister and I
aren't doing things together,

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:12.370
if I work hard and achieve something
without her help, it makes her happy.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:15.290
So I think Sarah-<i>san</i>
probably feels the same way.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:18.290
I know that much.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.590
Leah-<i>san</i>?

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:23.300
That's why I've been trying hard.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:26.220
I wanted to show her
that I'll be okay without her and

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:28.640
that she doesn't have to worry.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:32.060
And yet...

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:34.640
When it was her last Love Live...

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:40.070
Then you can just make sure
it's not the last performance, right?!

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:41.070
What?

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:42.360
What? What?

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.740
Er... H-Hey...

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.710
--Wow...!
--Wow...!

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:03.130
Why don't we sing together?

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:08.550
Let's make a song dedicated to our sisters

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:12.560
and sing again... in this light...!

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:18.190
<i>Try and be brave</i>

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:20.730
<i>I know it's actually scary</i>

00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:26.740
<i>It's not like I was able</i>
<i>to</i> <i>do it from the start, either</i>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:29.570
<i>I messed up a lot</i>

00:22:29.570 --> 00:22:32.240
<i>I was really frustrated</i>

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:37.790
<i>But</i> <i>that</i> <i>gave</i> <i>me</i> <i>strength,</i>
<i>so</i> <i>just</i> <i>don't</i> <i>give</i> <i>up</i>

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:43.500
<i>Tears</i> <i>in</i> <i>your</i> <i>eyes</i>
<i>that</i> <i>want</i> <i>to</i> <i>try</i> <i>believing</i>

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.760
<i>Say "bye-bye" to hesitation and tears</i>

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:49.430
<i>Now, let's go!</i>

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:54.600
<i>Let's chase them as</i> <i>many</i> <i>times</i>
<i>as it takes, don't lose</i>

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:57.850
<i>Everyone fails sometimes</i>

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:00.900
<i>But dreams won't fade, dreams won't fade</i>

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:06.280
<i>Let's chase them as</i> <i>many</i> <i>times</i>
<i>as it takes, don't lose</i>

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:14.330
<i>'Cause today is today, and once</i>
<i>you</i> <i>wake up, it'll be a new morning</i>

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:22.330
<i>Oh, the sun's smiling down on you</i>

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:40.870
--Next Time! "Awaken the power."
--Next Time! "Awaken the power."
